shevel as queen charlotte  and of course reggae jean-page as simon  bassett  adding simone ashley to the mix furthers  the diverse representation we'll get to  see on screen  in ashley's personal life breaking  conventions has been part of her daily  life since she was a young girl  the actor grew up in a family filled  with indian academics with whom she's  very very close  sometimes a bit too close you're so  picky mum  ashley has said that her parents were a  bit stifling at times because they were  so overprotective of her  though it was all out of love however  considering all of this  it means that her choice to be an actor  was not a small decision welcomed with  open arms or approached lightly  ashley has said that it made her family  very nervous when she wanted to pursue a  career in the arts due to the  uncertainty and precarity of the  industry  despite their worries and reservations  ashley knew creativity was her calling  and chose to take the leap  despite the unpredictable lifestyle she  knew she would be facing  even now she still has to reassure her  family that she will be okay  though maybe she won't need to as much  after this  major casting announcement we're glad  she followed her creative instincts  ashley wanted to break the mold and  rebel against indian stereotypes  a pursuit she has definitely succeeded  at  we know that she will be jonathan  bailey's love interest on screen in  bridgerton but this actually isn't the  first time they'll be sharing the screen  the two appeared in the british serial  crime drama broadchurch  a few years ago while this is simone  ashley's first major leading role  she is no stranger to the netflix screen  having appeared in the hit show sex  education  as the frustrated mean girl olivia your  bag's fake  your mascara is clumpy you'll never have  the right body type to get a proper  thigh gap she's also acted alongside  some pretty big names like ryan reynolds  in the movie pokemon detective pikachu  yeah pika pika pika he's adorable  you're adorable she's also appeared on  the bbc show's casualty and doctors  so what does this actress love  i don't want to get in trouble well  she's a big rock and roll fan and has  listed fleetwood mac  the doors and the rolling stones as some  of her favorite bands  this love for music was definitely  inspired by her father who is both an  academic and a creative  ashley once said that her father was  very passionate about music photography  and film always having music playing  while she was growing up  from what we've gathered from her  instagram she seems to be a  huge animal lover and foodie as well we  were also delighted  to see the photos she posted with her  sex education cast mates  hopefully she'll be sharing plenty of  bridgeton content as well  if we weren't already looking forward to  season 2 dropping we definitely are now  simone ashley feels like the perfect  addition to the bridgeton series  even co-star jonathan bailey and writer  of the books julia quinn  agree  [Music]  you
 

